[warriors-4p missions]
author=warriors-4p
description=Experimental: M6 mission fixes - X1 delete guard (LEAVE player 3/4 before a script deletes his human), X3 HuChangePlayerGang wrapper, X7 starting items for players 3-4 (owed again after a forced leave), X4 teleport follow, X6 Lua fixes after each script file (LUACH; M13 subway camera guard); needs session, 4p spawn and spawn leave (m6_fixes.md, m6_chooser.md, m6_x4_x6.md).

patch=2,EE,00358624,word,0C039D20 // X1: was 0C08CFBC jal 0x00233EF0 (HuDelete core) -> jal 0x000E7480 X1D; delay slot daddu a0,v0,zero kept
