patch=2,EE,000E7A00,word,27BDFFC0 // LUACH: addiu sp, sp, -64  ; LUACH(L, buffer, size, name): replaces DoBuffer's (FUN_00356AD0) call of lua_dobuffer (0x00356AD8); runs the chunk, logs its name, then the W4P fix sources registered for that chunk name
